{"id":"88d284a5e496e4ef","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-multiplication-function.md","title":"Multiplication Function","display":"df-multiplication-function — Multiplication Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-multiplication-function","aliases":["90-df-multiplication-function","90-df-mul"],"display":"df-multiplication-function — Multiplication Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","[[90-df-composition-operator]]","[[90-df-addition-function]]","[[90-df-zero-function]]","[[90-df-projection-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-multiplication-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-multiplication-function</span><span>90-df-mul</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multiplication-function — Multiplication Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"220648f3ca864e2c\" href=\"?note=220648f3ca864e2c\" title=\"90-df-addition-function\">90-df-addition-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-multiplication-function-—-Multiplication-Function-$\\mathrm{mul}$\">df-multiplication-function — Multiplication Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul}\">\\(\\mathrm{mul}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(Z : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (零函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{add} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (加法函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"220648f3ca864e2c\" href=\"?note=220648f3ca864e2c\" title=\"90-df-addition-function\">90-df-addition-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1^1 : \\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\pi_1^1 : \\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1^3,\\pi_3^3:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\pi_1^3,\\pi_3^3:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (投影函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{mul} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (multiplication function, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span> (primitive-recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> (composition operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{mul} \\coloneqq \\mathrm{PrimRec}(Z,\\mathrm{Comp}(\\mathrm{add},\\pi_1^3,\\pi_3^3)) : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{mul} \\coloneqq \\mathrm{PrimRec}(Z,\\mathrm{Comp}(\\mathrm{add},\\pi_1^3,\\pi_3^3)) : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul}(x, y) = x \\times y\">\\(\\mathrm{mul}(x, y) = x \\times y\\)</span>（乘法函数）</li>\n<li>形式化构造：\n<ul>\n<li>基函数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g = Z\">\\(g = Z\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(x) = 0\">\\(g(x) = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li>递归函数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h = \\mathrm{Comp}(\\mathrm{add}, \\pi_1^3, \\pi_3^3)\">\\(h = \\mathrm{Comp}(\\mathrm{add}, \\pi_1^3, \\pi_3^3)\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x, y, z) = \\mathrm{add}(x, z)\">\\(h(x, y, z) = \\mathrm{add}(x, z)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul}(x,0)=0\">\\(\\mathrm{mul}(x,0)=0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul}(x,y+1)=\\mathrm{add}(x,\\mathrm{mul}(x,y))\">\\(\\mathrm{mul}(x,y+1)=\\mathrm{add}(x,\\mathrm{mul}(x,y))\\)</span>；递归计数器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 不能误作被乘数。</li>\n<li>由原始递归算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span> 构造，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{mul} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a> — 原始递归算子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"220648f3ca864e2c\" href=\"?note=220648f3ca864e2c\" title=\"90-df-addition-function\">90-df-addition-function</a> — 加法函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a> — 截断减法</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a> — 零函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-multiplication-function-—-Multiplication-Function-$\\mathrm{mul}$","text":"df-multiplication-function — Multiplication Function $\\mathrm{mul}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-primrec-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-addition-function","status":"resolved","id":"220648f3ca864e2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"